# EP-online / overheid.io API key (runtime energielabel lookups).
# Request a key via RVO: https://www.rvo.nl/onderwerpen/wetten-en-regels-gebouwen/ep-online
# The bundled demo dataset (PDOK BAG) works without a key; the key only
# enables live per-address energielabel queries through src/api/epOnline.ts.
# VITE_EPONLINE_API_KEY=
